cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "BioCluster"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as follows:"
type: software

abstract: >
  BioCluster is a Python toolkit for the quantitative and
  qualitative characterization of Pareto-optimal gene clustering solutions.
  It provides consensus matrix computation, Jaccard and Rand-based similarity
  metrics, Gene Ontology enrichment integration, and interactive visualization
  utilities for downstream biological interpretation.

